## Issue / fix: Support CSI2031 (dark/light theme switching) + remove STDIN cache to avoid stale color queries

## Description
### Dark/Light theme auto and manual switching
The main user-facing addition in this PR is support for light/dark theme switches, both through the [CSI2031 protocol](https://github.com/contour-terminal/contour/blob/master/docs/vt-extensions/color-palette-update-notifications.md) and manually through 3 new actions: `zellij action set-dark-theme`, `zellij action set-light-theme` and `zellij action toggle-theme`.

In addition, Zellij now supports the `dark_theme` and `light_theme` optional configuration parameters. So one can define both in the same way one now defines the default `theme`:

```kdl
theme "dracula" // default
theme_dark "dracula" // will be used when the host terminal notifies the desktop now uses a dark theme or through the action
theme_light "catppuccin-latte" // will be used when the host terminal notifies the desktop now uses a light theme or through the action
```

This also includes a `HostTerminalThemeChanged` new plugin Event to be fired when any of the above changes happen.

Fixes https://github.com/zellij-org/zellij/issues/3831

